</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub471dd1a\" id=\"ub471dd1a\"><code data-lake-id=\"uee805200\" id=\"uee805200\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5afd08d9\" id=\"u5afd08d9\">main()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7df030c0\" id=\"u7df030c0\">是VIP客户，他只关心&quot;吃什么&quot;，不操心&quot;怎么做&quot;！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u70cbe01d\" id=\"u70cbe01d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43b77579\" id=\"u43b77579\">✨</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf7936491\" id=\"uf7936491\"> 看菜单（函数声明Declaration）→ 点菜（函数调用）→ 后厨处理（函数定义Definition(实现））</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Wi75X%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"E7nvO\" id=\"E7nvO\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua8d0bd75\" id=\"ua8d0bd75\">2&gt; 函数声明（Declaration）</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E7%AE%80%E6%98%93%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%98%BE%E5%BC%8F%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%20%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%99%A8%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%A8%E5%88%AB%E5%A4%84%5C%22%2C%20main%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%B0%BD%E7%AE%A1%E7%94%A8%5Cn%2F%2F%20extern%20int%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%20extern%20int%20sub(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%20extern%20int%20mul(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%20extern%20int%20div(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E9%9A%90%E5%BC%8F%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AFextern%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%9A%E5%B8%B8%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%99%5Cnint%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cnint%20sub(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cnint%20mul(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cnint%20div(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctint%20num1%20%3D%205%3B%5Cn%5Ctint%20num2%20%3D%206%3B%5Cn%5Ctint%20y%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%5Cty%20%3D%20add(num1%2C